## Media Controls for YouTube and Netflix

The phone remote gives you full media playback control when you're watching content on Chromecast with Google TV:

- **Play / Pause** — Toggle playback
- **Rewind / Fast-forward** — Skip back or ahead (10 seconds by default in most apps)
- **Volume Up / Down / Mute** — Control TV or soundbar volume
- **Previous / Next** — Skip tracks in music apps or episodes in playlists

These controls appear on the main remote screen. You don't need to navigate any menus — they're always visible and one tap away.

