## Common Troubleshooting Issues

### Chromecast Not Appearing in App

- Confirm both devices are on the same Wi-Fi network (not one on 2.4GHz and the other on 5GHz with different SSIDs)
- Restart the Chromecast (unplug and replug)
- Check that your router doesn't have **AP isolation** or **client isolation** enabled — this blocks devices from communicating with each other on the same network

### Commands Are Delayed or Laggy

- Move your phone closer to the Wi-Fi router
- Check if other devices are congesting the network
- Restart the app and reconnect

### PIN Screen Not Appearing on TV

- The TV may already be paired with the maximum number of remotes — go to **Settings → Remotes & Accessories** and unpair old devices
- Restart the Chromecast

